    LLM: 'Game: Nine Five Two. Type: Quota trick-taking. 3 players. Targets: Dealer=9, Left=5, Right=2. Cumulative scoring: +1 per overtrick, -1 per undertrick. Card exchange after each hand. Target score: +10 or +20.',
    Player: 'Play Nine Five Two. Your target depends on your position: Dealer needs 9, Left needs 5, Right needs 2. Win exactly your target for best resultsâ€”over or under affects your score and triggers card exchange.',
